ng> - CO2 and temperature sensor for indoor air quality assessment</li> </ul> <p>The source code for this ongoing project can be found here <a href="https://github.com/Causality-Labs/Env_Sensor">Zephyr Env Sensor</a></p> <h2 id="steps">Steps</h2> <p>I did this on a Windows machine.</p> <h3 id="1-environment-setup">1. Environment Setup</h3> <ul> <li>Install nRF Connect SDK in VS Code</li> </ul> <h3 id="2-project-initialization">2. Project Initialization</h3> <ul> <li>Configure <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">prj.conf</code> with required modules (sensors, Bluetooth, etc.)</li> </ul> <figure class="highlight"><pre><code class="language-ini" data-lang="ini"><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
